{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06761","headline":"杂兴 · 王昌龄","name":"杂兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握中铜匕首，粉剉楚山铁。\n义士频报雠，杀人不曾缺。\n可悲燕丹事，终被狼虎灭。\n一举无两全，荆轲遂爲血。\n诚知匹夫勇，何取万人杰。\n无道吞诸侯，坐见九州裂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}